  "notes": [
    "The BMC competition dataset is SYNTHETICALLY GENERATED (see the card). The policy is deliberately unchanged from the real-data design so the same code stays safe on any future real municipal data.",
    "Aliases are expectations (the Kaggle page and data dictionary were unreachable). Every column the aliases do not claim is 'unclassified' and default-denied for every task.",
    "Assign columns explicitly with --role-map after reading bmc_data_dictionary.csv; the adapter fails on ambiguous matches instead of choosing.",
    "Phases: identifier/at_submission < post_triage < post_resolution. Sensitive/PII roles are never read, stored or used."
